flowchart TD
  browser[Browser client]
  aiclients[AI clients]
  cli[CLI]
  repl[Interactive REPL]
  gui[GUI server]
  mcp[MCP server]
  commands[Command modules]
  engine[CodeSearchIndex engine]
  store[(On-disk index)]
  llm[LLM engines]

  browser -->|calls api routes| gui
  aiclients -->|speaks MCP over stdio| mcp
  cli -->|dispatches one command| commands
  repl -->|same do handlers| commands
  gui -->|route handlers| engine
  mcp -->|handleTool| engine
  commands -->|query the index| engine
  engine -->|builds saves loads| store
  commands -->|only on AI commands| llm

%% tip: CodeSearchIndex engine :: The one engine all four front-ends share.
%% tip: On-disk index :: A directory of plain JSON files. Build once, query from any front-end.
%% tip: LLM engines :: Optional. Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, or a local GGUF model.
%% tip: only on AI commands :: The core loop has no model in it.
